00691_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"基本的に女子寮は男子禁制だぞ。若い女が男を部屋に連れ込むなど、風紀に関わる","en":"Basically, the girls' dorm is off-limits to boys. It's not right for young women to bring men into their rooms, it's a matter of discipline."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"寮生に頼まれたら、特別に訓練をつける事もある。少しでも実力をつけたいという気持ちは大切だからな","en":"If a dorm resident asks me, I might give them special training. The desire to get stronger is important, after all."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"対魔忍の親は対魔忍だからな、任務で亡くなる事も多い。だからこそ、若者が生きる為に五車学園には寮が必要なんだ","en":"Taimanin often have Taimanin parents, and many of them die on missions. That's why the dorm is necessary for the young people at Gosha Academy."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"寮母という響きからよく誤解する者もいるが、私はそんなに年上ではない。勘違いするな","en":"Some people misunderstand because of my title as a dorm mother, but I'm not that much older than you. Don't get the wrong idea."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"んぉおおぉっ☆　ビシビシ鞭打ち効くぅうううぅっ！　おっぱいジンジンして、痛いはずなのにイクゥウウゥッ☆","en":"Ahhh, this is so good! The whip is really effective! My breasts are all tingly, and it hurts, but I'm going to come!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00691_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"ああ、オマンコ疼いちゃうぅっ、ヘコヘコエア腰振りする姿、寮生には絶対見せられないのぉおおぉっ！","en":"Ah, my pussy is throbbing... I'd never be able to show the dorm residents a sight like this, with my hips swaying back and forth..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00691_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":3,"text":{"ja":"寮母の仕事なんてもうどうでもいいから、早くオマンコの奥にビュービューザーメン出して本当の母親にしてぇ……♪","en":"I don't care about my job as a dorm mother anymore, just hurry up and come inside me and make me a real mother..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00691_1_hom_r18_3.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00691_1/uni00691_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip